{"ref":"BDB, מ֥וֹאָבִי","hw":"מ֥וֹאָבִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מ֥וֹאָבִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹאֲבִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent. Moabitish</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.4\">Dt 23:4</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאָבִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" href=\"/Ezra.9.1\">Ezr 9:1</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.11\">Dt 2:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹאָב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.29\">Dt 2:29</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹאֲבִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:22\" href=\"/Ruth.1.22\">Ru 1:22</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאֲב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:10\" href=\"/Ruth.4.10\">Ru 4:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹאָבִית</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.26\">2 Ch 24:26</a>; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹאֲבִיוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.1\">1 K 11:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.23\">Ne 13:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאֲב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:4\" href=\"/Ruth.1.4\">Ru 1:4</a>:—m. = <em>a Moabite</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.4\">Dt 23:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.1\">Ne 13:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּ׳</span> = <em>the Moabite</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.46\">1 Ch 11:46</a>; coll. = <em>the Moabites</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:1\" href=\"/Ezra.9.1\">Ezr 9:1</a>, so pl. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.11\">Dt 2:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.29\">29</a>; fpl. as adj. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָשִׁים מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:4\" href=\"/Ruth.1.4\">Ru 1:4</a>; as subst., <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.1\">1 K 11:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.23\">Ne 13:23</a>; fs. as adj. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.26\">2 Ch 24:26</a>; especially <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּת הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:22\" href=\"/Ruth.1.22\">Ru 1:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:2\" href=\"/Ruth.2.2\">2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:21\" href=\"/Ruth.2.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:5\" href=\"/Ruth.4.5\">4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:10\" href=\"/Ruth.4.10\">10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> as n.fs. <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:6\" href=\"/Ruth.2.6\">Ru 2:6</a>.","next":"BDB, מוֹאל","prev":"BDB, מוֹאָב"}